00:13:59.030 --> 00:14:08.070
<v Chris Sacca>They almost uniformly said they couldn't talk to you. They're afraid to. And they didn't even hem and haw about it. They just said, they're afraid to talk about this issue on the record.
<v Chris Sacca>他们几乎一致表示不能和你谈。他们很害怕。他们甚至没有支支吾吾。他们只是说，他们不敢公开讨论这个问题。

