00:35:04.460 --> 00:35:16.450
<v Ira Glass>It's This American Life . I'm Ira Glass. Today on our show, "When Patents Attack," stories about how our patent system sometimes seems to be discouraging rather than encouraging innovation in high-tech businesses.
