<v Alex Blumberg>If you could explain, the story you're telling is that you bought this patent from this inventor, Chris Crawford, and then you sold it a little bit later. But then if you actually look at the history, it's a very different story. It seems very different. So I'm trying to figure out if you could explain to us--
<v Alex Blumberg>如果你能解释一下，你们讲的故事是你们从这位发明家Chris Crawford那里买下了专利，然后过了一会儿卖掉了。但如果你看历史记录，这是一个非常不同的故事。看起来非常不同。所以我试图弄清楚你们是否能向我们解释——

