<v Alex Blumberg>Tom said Oasis more likely falls into a second category, companies that are independently owned, but with close links to Intellectual Ventures. For example, John Desmarais, the lawyer representing Oasis, also represents Intellectual Ventures in lots of cases, and has links to that company going back almost a decade.
<v Alex Blumberg>Tom说Oasis更可能属于第二类，即独立拥有但与Intellectual Ventures有着密切联系的公司。例如，代表Oasis的律师John Desmarais也代理Intellectual Ventures的许多案件，并与该公司有近十年的联系。

