00:42:16.050 --> 00:42:41.930
<v Laura Sydell>So we went back to Intellectual Ventures one more time to talk to Peter Detkin. We picked up where we left off the last time-- when did Intellectual Ventures actually buy Chris Crawford's patent? And this time he had no hesitation about explaining it. It turns out Tom Ewing had been right. Those other mysterious companies-- Kwon Holdings and Enhanced Software-- they were Intellectual Ventures' shell companies.
<v Laura Sydell>所以我们又一次回到Intellectual Ventures找Peter Detkin谈。我们从上次结束的地方继续——Intellectual Ventures到底是什么时候买下Chris Crawford专利的？这一次他毫不犹豫地解释了。事实证明Tom Ewing是对的。那些神秘的公司——Kwon Holdings和Enhanced Software——它们确实是Intellectual Ventures的空壳公司。

