<v Alex Blumberg>We showed Detkin that court document from the Oasis case listing Intellectual Ventures as an interested party.
<v Alex Blumberg>我们向Detkin展示了Oasis案件中将Intellectual Ventures列为利害关系人的那份法庭文件。

